	</string>
	<string id="ui_mcm_mag_check_hud_show_breakdown_desc">
		<text>On mixed magazines, show how many rounds of each type are loaded, e.g. '12 AP / 18 FMJ'. Off by default.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="ui_mcm_mag_check_hud_show_next_round">
